#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:library.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Access the \"<strong>Membership Subscription</strong>\" product. Navigate to "
"the <strong>Recurring Prices tab</strong> and define the recurring price, "
"specifying whether it's <strong>Yearly </strong>or\n"
"                    <strong>Monthly.</strong><br/>"
msgstr ""
"ເຂົ້າເຖິງສິນຄ້າ \"<strong>ການສະໝັກສະມາຊິກ</strong>\". ໄປທີ່ <strong>ແຖບລາຄາແບບປະຈຳ</"
"strong> ແລ້ວກຳນົດລາຄາແບບປະຈຳ, ໂດຍລະບຸວ່າເປັນແບບ <strong>ລາຍປີ </strong>ຫຼື\n"
"                    <strong>ລາຍເດືອນ.</strong><br/>"

#. module: library
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:library.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Adapt the <strong>Members Pricelist </strong>from Subscription / Products / "
"Pricelists. This pricelist will determine the special pricing for members, "
"while non-members will be charged the standard product prices."
msgstr ""
"ປັບປ່ຽນ <strong>ລາຍການລາຄາສຳລັບສະມາຊິກ </strong>ຈາກ ການສະໝັກສະມາຊິກ / ສິນຄ້າ / "
"ລາຍການລາຄາ. ລາຍການລາຄານີ້ຈະກຳນົດລາຄາພິເສດສຳລັບສະມາຊິກ, "
"ສ່ວນຜູ້ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເປັນສະມາຊິກຈະຖືກຄິດໄລ່ຕາມລາຄາສິນຄ້າປົກກະຕິ."

#. module: library
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:library.welcome_article_body
msgid "Add the <b>Membership Subscription </b>product to the lines."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມສິນຄ້າ <b>ການສະໝັກສະມາຊິກ </b>ໃສ່ໃນແຖວລາຍການ."

#. module: library
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:library.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Add your website to the <b>Ecommerce tab</b> for the <strong>website "
"pricelist.</strong>"
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມເວັບໄຊຂອງທ່ານໃສ່ໃນ <b>ແຖບອີຄອມເມີຊ</b> ສຳລັບ <strong>ລາຍການລາຄາເວັບໄຊ.</strong>"

