#: model_terms:product.template,description:library.product_product_21_product_template
msgid ""
"ROLLING STONES Rewind (1984 UK 12-track vinyl LP featuring a compilation of "
"classic hits from 1971-84 including Brown Sugar Start Me Up Miss You Beast "
"Of Burden and more housed in the glossy picture sleeve with lyric inner. The "
"sleeve shows only minor storage wear whilst the vinyl displays some cosmetic "
"scuffs not affecting play CUN1) 1. Brown Sugar2. Undercover Of the Night3. "
"Start Me Up4. Tumbling Dice5. Its Only Rock &amp; Roll6. Shes So Cold7. Miss "
"You8. Beast Of Burden9. Fool to Cry10. Waiting On A Friend11. Angie12. "
"Respectable."
msgstr ""
"ROLLING STONES Rewind (ແຜ່ນສຽງໄວນິນ 12 ເພງ ປີ 1984 ຈາກອັງກິດ ລວມເພງຮິດຄລາສສິກຕັ້ງແຕ່ປີ "
"1971-84 ລວມທັງ Brown Sugar, Start Me Up, Miss You, Beast Of Burden ແລະ ອື່ນໆ "
"ບັນຈຸໃນຊອງຮູບເງົາພ້ອມຊອງໃສ່ເນື້ອເພງດ້ານໃນ. ຕົວຊອງມີຮອຍເກົ່າຕາມການເວລາເລັກນ້ອຍ "
